cff-version: 1.2.0
license: AGPL-3.0-only
title: "MetaMining: pure-Mojo latent space explorer with topological shape views"
version: 0.9.0
date-released: 2026-10-31
authors:
  - name: "John Kost"
abstract: >-
  Parallel-branch survey instrument for language-model output space:
  novelty/coherence scoring, Pareto frontiers, Vietoris-Rips topology
  (Betti numbers, persistence barcodes, merge trees, Mapper), live
  steering with per-thread stop rules, and replayable journals plus
  research export bundles.
keywords:
  - latent-space-exploration
  - quality-diversity
  - topological-data-analysis
  - persistent-homology
  - llm-evaluation
  - confabulation
